{"script":"sub_0_11_1","des":"挖掘结晶","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":0,"y":10,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara2"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你发现了吧？你也发现了吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我们之前讨论过的“元素结晶”，在那个蛇什么的矿坑里简直满世界都是！[r][l]不止是有红色的，还有各种各样颜色的……一定是蕴含着其他属性的力量吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":20,"y":0,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara2"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊我现在不太想听你那些关于地脉和矿物元素互相作用的推论和研究啦……[r][l]我只是说，如果有伙伴需要那些结晶突破瓶颈，那岂不是唾手可——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉？蛇腹矿坑说到底也是驿站管辖的属地？采他们的矿至少要和他们说一声？[r][l]不是，先不说这是不是一种矿产，这么礼貌也太不荒野客了吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":0,"y":10,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara2"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好了好了我知道了啦！我、我又不是要偷——我去就是了！我去！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}